    <obo:IAO_0000115>An occurrence of cloning a (presumably previously cloned) insert from one vector to another to gain the desired functionality of the insert; or, an attribute of a participant in such an occurrence, e.g., of being or having been cloned into another vector.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <rdfs:label>occurrence/attribute of subcloning</rdfs:label>
    <craft:annotatable_text>subclone; subclones; subcloning; subclonings; subcloned; sub-clone; sub-clones; sub-cloning; sub-clonings; sub-cloned</craft:annotatable_text>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://craftcorpus.org/CRAFT_attribute_of_nonsense_variation">
