    <obo:IAO_0000115>An occurrence of producing a clone in the form of either a sequence or a bearer of a such a sequence (e.g., cell or organism); or, an attribute of a participant in such an occurrence, e.g., an attribute of being or having been cloned.</obo:IAO_0000115>
